  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">레전드이신 이동준 선생님과 김정식 선생님의 버전이 이미 훌륭하지만&#160;<br>저도 만들어보고 싶었어요.(그럴 수 있쟎아요. ;;)<br>점차 제가 독립적인 수업 설계를 할 수 있다는 약간의 만족감 입니다.<br>제 앱은 우선 여러 언어로 되어 있어요. 하하&#160;<br>그리고 스트로보 모션 캡쳐 사진 합성 전에 미리 영상을 찍어 두어야 하고<br>그 영상 찍을 때의 팁 들이 두 번째 화면에서 상세히 설명 되어 있다는 정도입니다.<br>사진의 선명도를 더 개선하고 싶지만 여러번 하다가 오류가 나니까 힘들어서 요정도에서 멈춥니다.<br>자유낙하는 잘 되는지 아직 안해봤지만 딱풀 굴렸을 때는 문제가 없었어요.&#160;<br>그리고 모바일에서 바로 된다는 장점이 있어요^^<br>안드로이드 구글 스토어에 올리고 싶은데 초기 비용이 3만원 남짓이 드네요. 나중에 필 받으면 올려보고 아님 우선 샘들께 공유해 봅니다<br><b> <a href=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/</span></a></b><br>앱 사용 순서 입니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f7598b9dcc0f57aec956a83a107db2df1934060\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f7598b9dcc0f57aec956a83a107db2df1934060\" data-origin-width=\"840\" data-origin-height=\"526\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43e696f57d3383e4e8dde51c12c72a396b9cfd25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"662\" height=\"321\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43e696f57d3383e4e8dde51c12c72a396b9cfd25\" data-origin-width=\"1753\" data-origin-height=\"851\"><div class=\"figcaption\">1. 처음 버전</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Strobo Motion Capture\" data-og-description=\"&#127760; Language / 언어 &#127472;&#127479;한국어Korean &#127482;&#127480;EnglishEnglish &#127466;&#127480;Espa&#241;olSpanish &#127467;&#127479;Fran&#231;aisFrench &#127465;&#127466;DeutschGerman &#127471;&#127477;日本語Japanese &#127464;&#127475;中文Chinese &#127479;&#127482;РусскийRussian &#127480;&#127462;&#1575;&#1604;&#1593;&#1585;&#1576;&#1610;&#1577;Arabic &#127463;&#127479;P\" data-og-host=\"hyoseonoh5.github.io\" data-og-source-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/\" data-og-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/motion-capture/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Strobo Motion Capture</p><p class=\"og-desc\">&#127760; Language / 언어 &#127472;&#127479;한국어Korean &#127482;&#127480;EnglishEnglish &#127466;&#127480;Espa&#241;olSpanish &#127467;&#127479;Fran&#231;aisFrench &#127465;&#127466;DeutschGerman &#127471;&#127477;日本語Japanese &#127464;&#127475;中文Chinese &#127479;&#127482;РусскийRussian &#127480;&#127462;&#1575;&#1604;&#1593;&#1585;&#1576;&#1610;&#1577;Arabic &#127463;&#127479;P</p><p class=\"og-host\">hyoseonoh5.github.io</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c01b1f5adcc47328a48da19865e5bb3943768251\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c01b1f5adcc47328a48da19865e5bb3943768251\" data-origin-width=\"1328\" data-origin-height=\"645\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2. 개선 사항 (버튼 누르면 선명한 버전으로 합성해 줍니다. - 빈칸 반투명하게 채우는 방식)-운동 분석에 더 적합</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">사진을 선명하게 할 수 있는 키를 선택할 수 있어요. (개선 사항)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7af9dae19340553ec3ebbf7603f35c7eaeb7273\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7af9dae19340553ec3ebbf7603f35c7eaeb7273\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7d43eb528a258492e6a5f8e228a31fa6110bbbc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7d43eb528a258492e6a5f8e228a31fa6110bbbc\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1920\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이 아래는 자유 낙하 영상 찍은게 없어서 유투브 슬로모션 영상을 화면캡쳐해서 분석해 본 것입니다. 실제 자유낙하를 슬로 모션으로 촬영하여 분석하면 이것보다는 나은 해상도를 보일 것으로 생각됩니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/580ec56641f0b011faea6ddf910e8c6449327c3b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/580ec56641f0b011faea6ddf910e8c6449327c3b\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2340\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c46ef667b016aae178795bb73323111169fef004\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c46ef667b016aae178795bb73323111169fef004\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2340\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a03605aa233c3b8f33b933ebfaf521f8a66635a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a03605aa233c3b8f33b933ebfaf521f8a66635a7\" data-origin-width=\"2340\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
